{"id": 20380, "title": "My big family", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "my-big-family", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/20380_my-big-family.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我有一个大家庭。 我的爸爸是中学老师， 妈妈是护士， 现在他们都已经退休了。 我没有亲兄弟姐妹， 是独生女。 但是我并不孤单， 因为我有两个堂哥和三个表妹， 我们一起长大， 非常快乐。 我以前是个公务员， 后来有了孩子， 我就做了家庭主妇。 我的爱人是外国人， 在IT 公司工作， 是个程序员。 他有三个兄弟。 他的大哥非常聪明， 是个大学教授。 他的二哥很高， 是个运动员。 他的弟弟还是学生， 现在一边打工一边读大学。 我的公公是银行职员， 我的婆婆是超市的营业员， 现在都七十多岁了， 还在工作。 你的家庭怎么样？"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我有一個大家庭。 我的爸爸是中學老師， 媽媽是護士， 現在他們都已經退休了。 我沒有親兄弟姐妹， 是獨生女。 但是我並不孤單， 因為我有兩個堂哥和三個表妹， 我們一起長大， 非常快樂。 我以前是個公務員， 後來有了孩子， 我就做了家庭主婦。 我的愛人是外國人， 在IT 公司工作， 是個程序員。 他有三個兄弟。 他的大哥非常聰明， 是個大學教授。 他的二哥很高， 是個運動員。 他的弟弟還是學生， 現在一邊打工一邊讀大學。 我的公公是銀行職員， 我的婆婆是超市的營業員， 現在都七十多歲了， 還在工作。 你的家庭怎麼樣？"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ yǒu yī gè dà jiā tíng。  wǒ de bà ba shì zhōng xué lǎo shī，  mā ma shì hù shi，  xiàn zài tā men dōu yǐ jīng tuì xiū le。  wǒ méi yǒu qīn xiōng dì jiě mèi，  shì dú shēng nǚ。  dàn shì wǒ bìng bù gū dān，  yīn wèi wǒ yǒu liǎng gè táng gē hé sān gè biǎo mèi，  wǒ men yī qǐ zhǎng dà，  fēi cháng kuài lè。  wǒ yǐ qián shì gè gōng wù yuán，  hòu lái yǒu le hái zi，  wǒ jiù zuò le jiā tíng zhǔ fù。  wǒ de ài ren shì wài guó rén，  zài IT  gōng sī gōng zuò，  shì gè chéng xù yuán。  tā yǒu sān gè xiōng dì。  tā de dà gē fēi cháng cōng míng，  shì gè dà xué jiào shòu。  tā de èr gē hěn gāo，  shì gè yùn dòng yuán。  tā de dì di hái shì xué shēng，  xiàn zài yī biān dǎ gōng yī biān dú dà xué。  wǒ de gōng gong shì yín háng zhí yuán，  wǒ de pó po shì chāo shì de yíng yè yuán，  xiàn zài dōu qī shí duō suì le，  hái zài gōng zuò。  nǐ de jiā tíng zěn me yàng？"], "english_paragraphs": ["I have a big family. My father is a middle school teacher and my mother is a nurse. They are both retired now. I have no biological brothers or sisters, I am an only child. But I'm not alone, because I have two cousins ​​and three cousins, and we grew up together very happily. I used to be a civil servant, but after I had children, I became a housewife. My spouse is a foreigner, works in an IT company, and is a programmer. He has three brothers. His eldest brother is very smart and is a university professor. His second brother is very tall and an athlete. His younger brother is still a student and is currently studying at university while working part-time. My father-in-law is a bank clerk, and my mother-in-law is a supermarket salesperson. They are both in their seventies now and are still working. How is your family?"], "english_full": "I have a big family. My father is a middle school teacher and my mother is a nurse. They are both retired now. I have no biological brothers or sisters, I am an only child. But I'm not alone, because I have two cousins ​​and three cousins, and we grew up together very happily. I used to be a civil servant, but after I had children, I became a housewife. My spouse is a foreigner, works in an IT company, and is a programmer. He has three brothers. His eldest brother is very smart and is a university professor. His second brother is very tall and an athlete. His younger brother is still a student and is currently studying at university while working part-time. My father-in-law is a bank clerk, and my mother-in-law is a supermarket salesperson. They are both in their seventies now and are still working. How is your family?", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà\" data-defn=\"big; large; great / older (than another person) / eldest\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā tíng\" data-defn=\"family; household\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">家庭</span><span class=\"tr\">家庭</span><rt>jiā tíng</rt></ruby>。 <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ de\" data-defn=\"my; mine\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bà ba\" data-defn=\"(coll.) father; dad\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhōng xué\" data-defn=\"middle school\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中学</span><span class=\"tr\">中學</span><rt>zhōng xué</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo shī\" data-defn=\"teacher\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby>， <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mā ma\" data-defn=\"mama / mommy / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hù shi\" data-defn=\"nurse\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">护士</span><span class=\"tr\">護士</span><rt>hù shi</rt></ruby>， <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiàn zài\" data-defn=\"now; at present; currently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></r