-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dú shēng nǚ\" data-defn=\"a daughter who is an only child\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">独生女</span><span class=\"tr\">獨生女</span><rt>dú shēng nǚ</rt></ruby>。 <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dàn shì\" data-defn=\"but; however\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bìng\" data-defn=\"(not) at all\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">并</span><span class=\"tr\">並</span><rt>bìng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gū dān\" data-defn=\"lone / lonely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">孤单</span><span class=\"tr\">孤單</span><rt>gū dān</rt></ruby>， <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yīn wèi\" data-defn=\"because; owing to; on account of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">因为</span><span class=\"tr\">因為</span><rt>yīn wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</sp